msgstr "Instalado en su carpeta personal."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Install again…"
msgstr "Instalar de nuevo…"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Install…"
msgstr "Instalar…"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "JetBrains Toolbox"
msgstr "JetBrains Toolbox"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The app that installs JetBrains' IDEs and keeps them up to date, downloaded from JetBrains and checked against the checksum JetBrains publishes."
msgstr "La aplicación que instala los IDE de JetBrains y los mantiene al día, descargada de JetBrains y comprobada con la suma de verificación que publica JetBrains."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Command-line tools"
msgstr "Herramientas de línea de órdenes"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "eza, bat, ripgrep, zoxide, starship and more from Homebrew, with your shell set up to use them."
msgstr "eza, bat, ripgrep, zoxide, starship y más desde Homebrew, con su shell preparado para usarlas."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
